// ============================================================================
//  ID:             Q06  (report appendix: listed as a second "A4", "Finding the user account")
//  Name:           Which account ran the commands
//  Purpose:        Identify the account behind process activity after the last exploit request.
//  Hunt step:      6
//  ATT&CK:         T1059.004 Command and Scripting Interpreter: Unix Shell
//  Tables:         HartwellSysmon_CL
//  Time range:     2026-10-23 09:57 to 16:00 UTC (starts at the last exploit POST from Q04)
//  Environment:    Practice lab
//  Hit looks like: A service account such as www-data running commands it never should.
//  Result:         www-data.
//  Benign noise:   Other accounts' normal activity appears in the list. Compare it to the baseline.
//  Tuning notes:   Set the start time to the last exploit request found in Q04.
//  Author / date:  Cai Spice · hunt run 2026-10-23, documented 2026-11-20
// ============================================================================

HartwellSysmon_CL
| where OriginalTime between (datetime(2026-10-23T09:57:00Z) .. datetime(2026-10-23T16:00:00Z))
| distinct User
